   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CIH201 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.4</span>\n<h2>Textbooks, materials & tools the university names</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Main textbook: <strong>Contemporary Tourism: An International Approach (Fifth Edition)</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13666 · Decision 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 27/11/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CIH201 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.4</span>\n<h2>Giáo trình, tài liệu & công cụ trường quy định</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Giáo trình chính: <strong>Contemporary Tourism: An International Approach (Fifth Edition)</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13666 · QĐ 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 27/11/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Material<br><small>Tài liệu</small></th><th>Author<br><small>Tác giả</small></th><th>Publisher<br><small>NXB</small></th><th>Year<br><small>Năm</small></th><th>Edition<br><small>Lần xuất bản</small></th><th>ISBN</th><th>Main<br><small>Chính</small></th><th>Hard copy<br><small>Bản in</small></th><th>Online</th><th>Note<br><small>Ghi chú</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Contemporary Tourism: An International Approach (Fifth Edition)</strong></td><td>Chris Cooper, C. Michael Hall</td><td>Goodfellow Publishers</td><td>2022</td><td>5th</td><td><code>978-1-915097-17-0</code></td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Sustainability in the Hospitality Industry: Principles of Sustainable Operations</strong></td><td>Willy Legrand, Joseph S. Chen, Gabriel C. M. Laeis</td><td>Routledge</td><td>2022</td><td>4th</td><td><code>9780367532505</code></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Artificial Intelligence for Smart Technology in the Hospitality and Tourism Industry</strong></td><td>Vinod Kumar Shukla, Amit Verma, Jean Paolo G. Lacap</td><td>Routledge</td><td>2024</td><td>1st</td><td><code>9781774914908</code></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>Group Evaluation Form for Instructor: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ewve8owoERs-gmaKt_w9yNBYAaSvkmfV\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ewve8owoERs-gmaKt_w9yNBYAaSvkmfV</a></strong></td><td>Many Sources</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>Group Evaluation Form for Others groups: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ewve8owoERs-gmaKt_w9yNBYAaSvkmfV\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ewve8owoERs-gmaKt_w9yNBYAaSvkmfV</a></strong></td><td>Many Sources</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>Individual Evaluation Form for Instructor: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ewve8owoERs-gmaKt_w9yNBYAaSvkmfV\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ewve8owoERs-gmaKt_w9yNBYAaSvkmfV</a></strong></td><td>Many Sources</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>Topics References: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1SXMTSL1wVXFym3pA2LiBpy7wR57PQnE3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1SXMTSL1wVXFym3pA2LiBpy7wR57PQnE3</a></strong></td><td>Many Sources</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Tools</h3>\n<p>Internet sources &amp; AI tools ( Students are encouraged to use, Notion AI, SciSpace, and Elicit for self-study, concept explanation, and summarizing trends. For data analysis in hospitality, tools like Excel Copilot, Wolfram Alpha, and ChatGPT Code Interpreter help visualize industry statistics.)</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Materials with no author/ISBN (slides, exercise packs…) are usually internal files you download inside FLM with your FPT account. Buy the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed — page and exercise numbers change between editions.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Công cụ</h3>\n<p>Internet sources &amp; AI tools ( Students are encouraged to use, Notion AI, SciSpace, and Elicit for self-study, concept explanation, and summarizing trends. For data analysis in hospitality, tools like Excel Copilot, Wolfram Alpha, and ChatGPT Code Interpreter help visualize industry statistics.)</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN (slide, bộ bài tập…) thường là file nội bộ, tải trong FLM bằng tài khoản FPT. Mua đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng — số trang, số bài tập đổi giữa các bản.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13666\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13666</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13666\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13666</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
